## What this chapter grows into

1. Divisions in the editor's outline, as labels that group the headings between one divider and the next.
2. The Neovim and Zed chapters of Part IX fenced by the formatter, once a Loom that reads fenced code is published.

When dividers draw in the editor and on the woven page, the rest of this chapter joins the chapters that read a divider.
